  "subject": "a shy man at his aunt's Hari Raya rumah terbuka who keeps refilling the same guest's plate with rendang so he has a reason to stand next to her, until she is on her third plate and tells him to sit down and eat with her",
  "caption": "Malay gypsy jazz, Django-style jazz manouche swing at a relaxed tempo. Percussive la pompe rhythm guitar, bright Selmer-style lead acoustic guitar runs, sweet swinging violin answers, walking upright bass. Light wooden close-miked production. Female lead vocal, low-mid register, intimate and clearly sung. 112 BPM, G major. Warm, smitten mood. No drum kit, no synths, no autotune, no rap, no pop ballad strings.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - la pompe guitar, violin]\n\n[Verse 1]\nRumah terbuka mak cik kau\nAku cuma datang ikut kawan\nKau datang bawa senduk rendang\nTanya aku, nak tambah lagi?\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nAku angguk, padahal dah kenyang\n\n[Chorus]\nPinggan pertama, kau senyum malu\nPinggan kedua, kau tak berlalu\nPinggan ketiga, aku pun tahu\nKau bukan nak bagi rendang je, kan?\n\n[Verse 2]\nKuih makmur jatuh atas baju aku\nKau hulur tisu, tangan tergesa\nTetamu lain semua perasan\nMak cik kau dah kenyit mata\n\n[Chorus]\nPinggan pertama, kau senyum malu\nPinggan kedua, kau tak berlalu\nPinggan ketiga, aku tarik kerusi\nDuduklah, makan dengan aku\n\n[Outro - violin, guitar]\nTak payah tambah lagi\nDuduk sini dengan aku",
